{"unit_id":"wakeupnotfound__dsh-rsi#card-zh","repo":"wakeupnotfound/dsh-rsi","commit":"66efb6e343e8a0f66d74d7ad156268df122a0680","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rsi（DSH 插件，桌面客户端）：为 DeepSeek Harness 提供递归自我改进工具。它向会话注入认识论提示、记忆清单和使用协议，并注册验证、记忆检索与维护、探索和练习工具。主要功能包括对交付物生成独立验证提示、把经验整理为持久规则、检测记忆冲突，以及通过并行探索或失败驱动练习收集经验。适合希望让 DSH agent 在任务间复用经验并检查交付物的开发者。无需 API 密钥或外部服务；记忆保存在工作区或用户本机目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:181-208","lib/tools/definitions.js:55-128","lib/core/memory.js:51-69"]}
{"unit_id":"wakeupnotfound__dsh-rsi#card-en","repo":"wakeupnotfound/dsh-rsi","commit":"66efb6e343e8a0f66d74d7ad156268df122a0680","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-rsi is a DSH desktop plugin that adds guidance and memory context, plus tools for verification, durable memory, reconciliation, exploration, and practice. It helps agents audit deliverables and reuse lessons across tasks. No API key or external service is needed; memory is stored locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:181-208","lib/tools/definitions.js:55-128","lib/core/memory.js:51-69"]}
