{"unit_id":"wakeupnotfound__dsh-rsi#feature-verification","repo":"wakeupnotfound/dsh-rsi","commit":"66efb6e343e8a0f66d74d7ad156268df122a0680","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rsi 的功能「交付物独立验证」：根据任务目标和交付物准备只读探针并生成独立审计提示，可解析审计报告并应用明确疑点判定。通过 rsi_verify 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:212-240"]}
{"unit_id":"wakeupnotfound__dsh-rsi#feature-durable-memory","repo":"wakeupnotfound/dsh-rsi","commit":"66efb6e343e8a0f66d74d7ad156268df122a0680","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rsi 的功能「持久经验记忆」：按工作区或全局范围保存、读取和搜索经验规则，供后续任务检索。通过 rsi_distill_memory 与 rsi_query_memory 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools/definitions.js:71-105"]}
{"unit_id":"wakeupnotfound__dsh-rsi#feature-reconcile","repo":"wakeupnotfound/dsh-rsi","commit":"66efb6e343e8a0f66d74d7ad156268df122a0680","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rsi 的功能「记忆冲突对齐」：检查新旧经验的主题重叠和矛盾，识别演进规则并关联相关条目。通过 rsi_reconcile_memory 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools/definitions.js:87-94"]}
{"unit_id":"wakeupnotfound__dsh-rsi#feature-explore","repo":"wakeupnotfound/dsh-rsi","commit":"66efb6e343e8a0f66d74d7ad156268df122a0680","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rsi 的功能「并行探索」：为新仓库生成分波次的探索工作流，收集候选经验并交由独立验证，再提交通过审查的规则。通过 rsi_explore 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools/definitions.js:109-123"]}
{"unit_id":"wakeupnotfound__dsh-rsi#feature-practice","repo":"wakeupnotfound/dsh-rsi","commit":"66efb6e343e8a0f66d74d7ad156268df122a0680","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rsi 的功能「失败驱动练习」：将困难任务组织为失败、提炼、练习和重试循环，并对各次尝试进行验证。通过 rsi_practice 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools/definitions.js:127-143"]}
